[PrintTextModified Text:刚来到玛格的牢房前，<br>艾玛就听见里面传来叽叽喳喳的吵闹声。|#0102Adv09_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ボイス加工：カーテン越しの声

[PrintTextModified Text:你来做什么！！<br>我不是叮嘱过不准进来吗！|#0102Adv09_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ボイス加工：カーテン越しの声

[PrintTextModified Text:都说了我也想帮帮忙啊。<br>别看我这样，其实我手很巧的。|#0102Adv09_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ボイス加工：カーテン越しの声

[PrintTextModified Text:好啦，你就拿来给我吧。|#0102Adv09_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ボイス加工：カーテン越しの声

[PrintTextModified Text:呀——！<br>你这家伙竟敢直接上手拽！！|#0102Adv09_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ボイス加工：カーテン越しの声

[PrintTextModified Text:你、你们两位都冷静点……|#0102Adv09_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:2_1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:"（汉娜她们制作的是<br>　热气球的球皮部分。<br>　这是最重要的部分）|#0102Adv09_Ema001|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，艾玛小姐……！|#0102Adv09_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露走出门口，<br>便看到站在牢房前的艾玛。|#0102Adv09_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:对不起，现在房间里不让人进……|#0102Adv09_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯没事的，我明白。<br>毕竟要是有人进去弄破皮就麻烦了。|#0102Adv09_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; 布が破れる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_45 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:两人正聊着，<br>突然听见里面传来撕破了什么东西的声音。|#0102Adv09_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊……|#0102Adv09_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; ボイス加工：カーテン越しの声

[PrintTextModified Text:……现在我决定了。<br>我要把这家伙宰了！！|#0102Adv09_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ボイス加工：カーテン越しの声

[PrintTextModified Text:欸？你确定要这么说吗？<br>会被处刑的哦？|#0102Adv09_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ボイス加工：カーテン越しの声

[PrintTextModified Text:无所谓了！我一定要杀了你！|#0102Adv09_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听见房间里传来争执和喧闹声，<br>艾玛和梅露露的脸色愈发惨白。|#0102Adv09_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Surprised SubId:Middle
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:这、这里就交给我吧……<br>我去阻止她们……|#0102Adv09_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:拜托你了……！|#0102Adv09_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然梅露露反被吓得眼里都冒出了泪花，<br>但也只能拜托她去解决这场闹剧了。<br>于是艾玛离开了这里。|#0102Adv09_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

